  "notes": "Adds a real Use Header checkbox to the Background panel. With it off, the section is simply Background and the AO3 header is hidden. Turning it on reveals header layout controls plus separate Header Image / GIF upload and hosted-URL fields, position, fit, repeat, opacity, and existing resize/branding controls. Local header images/GIFs preview in-app; hosted direct URLs export to AO3 CSS. Keeps Quick Colors, numbered tabs, and all prior tools."
